from @gotgenes/pi-anthropic-auth 3.4.3 by Christopher D. Lasher (MIT):
https://github.com/gotgenes/pi-anthropic-auth

The upstream MIT copyright and permission notice are retained in LICENSE.
Ported portions: src/billing.ts, src/payload.ts, src/system-prompt.ts,
src/system-prompt-sections.ts. The provider-collection wiring and Web Crypto
implementation are adaptations for pi-ai 1.2.0 and Web API runtimes.

